WEBVTT

00:01:58.488 --> 00:02:01.915
It couldn't possibly be that you've just
come to a different conclusion

00:02:01.939 --> 00:02:03.090
in good faith?

00:02:03.114 --> 00:02:06.200
No, you must be up to something,
you must be stupid,

00:02:06.224 --> 00:02:08.258
bigoted, interested.

00:02:08.282 --> 00:02:09.626
Maybe you're insane.

00:02:09.650 --> 00:02:11.616
And the same goes the other way. Right?

00:02:11.640 --> 00:02:15.066
So the mere fact
of your disagreeing with me

00:02:15.090 --> 00:02:20.828
is implicitly an insult not only
to my views, but to my intelligence, too.

00:02:20.852 --> 00:02:24.232
And things only get worse
when the disagreements at stake

00:02:24.256 --> 00:02:27.193
are the ones that we somehow
consider to be fundamental,

00:02:27.217 --> 00:02:30.642
whether to our worldviews
or to our identities.